OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry overnight with cloudier skies in
OL,7,Fthe south at first, but becoming clear
OL,8,Facross the region with temperatures
OL,9,Ffalling away. It will feel cold
OL,10,Fcompared to Tuesday night with patchy
OL,11,Ffrost by dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA chilly and bright start,
OL,14,Fwith plenty of autumnal sunshine
OL,15,Fthroughout Thursday. Feeling colder
OL,16,Fthan Wednesday, especially in the
OL,17,Fnortherly breeze with a widespread
OL,18,Ffrost.developing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
