OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FAnother
OL,6,Fcrisp autumnal day on Friday after a
OL,7,Ffrosty start. It turns cloudier during
OL,8,Fthe weekend with temperatures creeping
OL,9,Fup, dry at first but some showers
OL,10,Fpossible on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
